My Role and Ownership-

I owned the end-to-end business intelligence workflow for this project, from
data preparation and KPI definition to dashboard design and business
interpretation.

My responsibilities included:

1. Cleaning and validating employee-level data using Power Query
2. Designing employee segmentation bands for age, income, tenure and promotion
3. Building reusable DAX measures for workforce and attrition analysis
4. Developing the Power BI reporting model
5. Designing four interactive analytical dashboard pages
6. Comparing employee segments against the company attrition benchmark
7. Interpreting attrition patterns across roles, departments and career stages
8. Translating analytical findings into practical workforce recommendations
